Tackle Treasury

Laru has an entire room at home dedicated to storing her fishing gear collection, which includes, but is by no means limited to:
Hooks, lines, rods, floats, sinkers, bait;
keepnets, landing nets, rod stands, fish finders;
trolling rods, reels, steel leaders, oversized lures;
heavy-duty boat rods, heavy-duty trolling rods...

As for that last pile of stuff... Laru herself is not exactly sure what all those are. She just got them out of the Monolith.
